<article class="env-remark" id="03WD">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03WD">Remark <span data-tag="03WD">11.5.0.88</span>.</a> See Corollary <a data-tag="04BF" href="/tag/04BF">8.4.5.2</a>. </p>
</article>
