<article class="env-exercise" id="010D">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/010D">Exercise <span data-tag="010D">11.5.0.129</span> <span class="named">(Symmetry)</span>.</a> Let $T \rightarrow S \leftarrow X$ be a diagram of simplicial sets. Show that the homotopy fiber products $T \times _{S}^{h} X$ and $X \times _{S}^{h} T$ have the same weak homotopy type (see Proposition <a data-tag="010Y" href="/tag/010Y">3.4.1.9</a> for a related statement). </p>
